["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Makes a Consumer AI Product Stick? | Josh Elman earn the right to do more inference cost microdrama personal agent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-a16z-判断消费-ai-产品-别问留存-问用户停掉了什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>判断消费 AI 产品，别问留存，问用户停掉了什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消费产品要过四道关：让人觉得新鲜、真的改用、愿意传播、长期留下。最锋利的检验只有一个问题——你开始用它之后，停掉了什么？答不上来，就说明它还没挤进任何人的生活。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费AI</span><span class=\"tag\">留存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Does AI need an antitrust exemption so it doesn&#x27;t kill everyone???? antitrust exemption regulatory capture products liability Section 230 national champions\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-decoder-ai-巨头要反垄断豁免-是安全还是卡特尔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95fbf504dc72e7ca-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">46:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头要反垄断豁免，是安全还是卡特尔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前 DOJ 反垄断主管 Jonathan Cantor 说，造安全产品不需要跟对手协调，就像波音舱门掉了不用找空客商量——所以任何形式的反垄断豁免都不该给。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Goldman M&amp;A Banker Helped Bring the Olympics to Los Angeles HOV lanes S-1 TMT EPS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-oddlots-ai-并购大年-但企业真正用起来的只有-2/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>AI 并购大年，但企业真正用起来的只有 2%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高盛并购联席主管 Gene Sykes 说，今年是史上最大并购年，驱动力是 AI 基建；但真正在财报里看到 AI 提升 EPS 的公司只有 2%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">并购</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 采用率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"20VC: &quot;Anti-Data Centres is a Chinese Psyop&quot; | How Many Planned Data Centers Will Actually Get Built? | Is Energy AI&#x27;s Biggest Bottleneck? With Thomas Sohmers, Co-Founder @ Positron KV cache memory wall MLA quantization Ruler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-twentyvc-反数据中心几乎全是中国的心理战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7ab4afdcb996c0d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>反数据中心几乎全是中国的心理战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国左右两派同时反对建数据中心，Thomas Sohmers 认为这几乎全是中国的心理战——中国自己在大建特建，却让西方在监管里自我拖慢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">推理经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Are carrots becoming less nutritious? dilution effect harvest index Broadbalk experiment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-moreorless-胡萝卜没变没营养-变的是小麦的锌和铁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">8:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>胡萝卜没变没营养，变的是小麦的锌和铁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「土壤养分耗尽导致蔬菜营养下降」这个流行说法没有数据支撑；真正被证实的是高产矮秆小麦的稀释效应，锌含量降了约一半。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品营养</span><span class=\"tag\">农业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bill Gurley: Searching for Feynman CAPA gain-of-function DEFUSE proposal furin cleavage site DRASTIC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-allin-新冠死了1500万人-却没人做一次独立调查/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b6e9b333e0d96e3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>新冠死了1500万人，却没人做一次独立调查</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Gurley 把新冠和 737 Max、卡特里娜飓风、福岛、挑战者号并列，发现一个反常：其他灾难都有独立调查和追责，新冠六年了连根因都没查。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新冠溯源</span><span class=\"tag\">制度失灵</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: PLA, 2027, Nukes, and the Pivot to Asia Pirouette strategic deterrence joint firepower strike nuclear shield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-chinatalk-2027-不是攻台日期-是解放军的能力清单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/901c5224bd5fbf46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>2027 不是攻台日期，是解放军的能力清单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2027 从来不是入侵日期，而是解放军要在那时拥有这个选项。真正暴露意图的是钱押在哪：战略制衡、战略决胜、战略威慑与控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">台海</span><span class=\"tag\">解放军</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Hugging Face Co-Founder on Open-Source, Microduck, and NVIDIA | E2339 unreasonable hospitality dream weaver pattern recognition minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-twist-把服务当成本中心-是商业上最大的误判/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/180714c4e231bd45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>把服务当成本中心，是商业上最大的误判</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">产品、品牌都会被超越，唯一长期护城河是让人感觉被看见；而这件事可以像给停车表投币一样被系统化，不靠预算靠用心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">服务文化</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Databricks CEO on AI Pacing, Cyber Risk, and the Enterprise pacing RSI CVE ontology harness branching\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-a16z-ai-放慢节奏是公关失误-网络攻击才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 放慢节奏是公关失误，网络攻击才是真风险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿实验室把安全包装成 pacing 是两头不讨好；真正紧迫的是 CVE 武器化时间从数年压到几分钟，而企业里还没有 agent，只有更快的搜索。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">网络攻击</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Investing for the AI Boom: Masters in Business with Glen Kacher XPU agentic AI SaaS-pocalypse behind the meter\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-mastersinbiz-ai-需求仍跑在供给前面-但算力瓶颈正在变成政治问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 需求仍跑在供给前面，但算力瓶颈正在变成政治问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Light Street 的 Glen Kacher 认为 AI 是 15 到 20 年的计算栈重构，现在只走完第一段的三分之一；真正的风险不是 CapEx 过度，而是电力与地方政治拖慢建设。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Domino’s Pizza Tracker Theory of Everything labor illusion out-the-door time pizza tracker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-planetmoney-披萨追踪器-我们被驯化成愿意为假进度条买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">32:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>披萨追踪器：我们被驯化成愿意为假进度条买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Domino&#x27;s 的披萨追踪器最初只是内部管理工具，后来变成全球 App 的标配。它之所以有效，是因为它把等待变成了看得见的工作；而当公司发现我们爱看进度条，就开始造假进度条。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品设计</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"On $L^p$ Density of Self-Similar Measures and Continuous Bernoulli Convolutions - Constantin Kogler self-similar measure Bernoulli convolution absolutely continuous L^p density Lean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-instituteforad-ai-半小时证出人类一年没做出的数学定理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3e280b6f6fbcbd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 半小时证出人类一年没做出的数学定理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个被卡住的 L^p 问题，AI 用半小时给出五页证明，把 60 页的论文压缩成核心引理，还顺手把连续密度的门槛从 588 推到 9。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 证明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Looney Tunes animator Chuck Jones / Remembering singer Cassandra Wilson yes session scatting Acme Corporation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-freshair-乐一通-动画师-角色不是画出来的-是想出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b48c92c9b28c25a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>《乐一通》动画师：角色不是画出来的，是想出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chuck Jones 说动画的关键不是角色长什么样、怎么画，而是「他是谁」——他先理解角色，才让 Daffy 同时怯懦又跋扈，让兔八哥必须先被招惹才反击。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">动画</span><span class=\"tag\">角色设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The last IMO problem AI could not solve Lean Erdős-Szekeres theorem motivated explanation LIS / LDS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-karpathy-ai-解不出的最后一道-imo-题-价值不在答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a156d48d62c56e56-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">51:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 解不出的最后一道 IMO 题，价值不在答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2025 年 IMO 第六题只有不到 1% 的选手拿满分，所有 AI 都卡在这题上。它难的不是计算，是必须先理解、先有审美，再动笔——而这恰恰是强化学习最难训练的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 与数学</span><span class=\"tag\">IMO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jared Isaacman: A New Era for NASA and American Space Exploration NEP MMRTG closed Brayton cycle TRL in-situ resource utilization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-allin-nasa-局长-我们不是采购机构-是核动力-nasa/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/432889fb9b668f60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>NASA 局长：我们不是采购机构，是核动力 NASA</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jared Isaacman 说 NASA 过去把资源摊到每个选区、为合作而合作，结果月球火箭效率不如土星五号；他要做的是核动力与核推进，把近地轨道交给 SpaceX 这类公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航天</span><span class=\"tag\">核动力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Trying to Save the World Is No Excuse John Doe delta hedge BDC target date fund\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-moneystuff-想拯救世界-不是搞垄断协议的借口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">38:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>想拯救世界，不是搞垄断协议的借口</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 实验室想联手放慢模型开发，但四家巨头坐下来谈减速，法律上就是教科书式的反垄断合谋——想拯救世界不构成抗辩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 竞赛</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The State of Startups in 2026 harness RL environments codegen system of record egocentric data\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-ycsp-硬科技占-yc-批次两成-软件公司正在被智能体吃掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9835cc1816c0414b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">36:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>硬科技占 YC 批次两成：软件公司正在被智能体吃掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">YC 最新批次里硬科技公司从 8% 涨到 20%，机器人、国防、半导体、电力全线翻倍；同时软件公司从卖工具转向卖「把活干完」，中位收入从 8K 涨到 20K。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬科技</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Sweetest Thing potency volatiles optogenetics erythrolose\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-radiolab-最甜的东西可能不是糖-而是照进脑子的一束光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/97fefade0b968e40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">31:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>最甜的东西可能不是糖，而是照进脑子的一束光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">按「甜度」排名，糖并不是最甜的；但按你实际尝到的甜，糖几乎无法被超越。更颠覆的是，用激光直接点亮甜味神经元，理论上能造出人类从未尝过的甜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">味觉</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E252 公积金新规来了，这笔钱该怎么用？这份行动清单供你参考 转移支付 职业年金 个人养老金\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-zhixing-公积金新规-能取则取-但别把它当存款/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0641b913c2f67c2e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>公积金新规：能取则取，但别把它当存款</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公积金不是随时能取的存款，虚假提取会被追责且三年内不能再取；但新规把租房提到提取首位、取消房租占收入比例限制，该取的钱还是该取。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公积金</span><span class=\"tag\">房地产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A.I. Safety Goes Mainstream + a ‘Hard Fork’ Exit AMA PDOOM embedded evaluators base model finishing school low concept\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-hardfork-ai-高管集体求监管-连加速派也开始发怵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 高管集体求监管：连加速派也开始发怵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario Amodei 呼吁在 AI 公司内部派驻常驻评估员，Altman、Musk、Hassabis 跟进——平时几乎什么都不同意的竞争对手，第一次公开说出私下说了多年的话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"CLARITY Failed, Many Stablecoins Debate, Circle Launches Arc &amp; Meta&#x27;s AI Edge | Weekly Roundup TSVS NMS stock transfer agent DAT CPN\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-empire-稳定币不是双寡头-大公司要发自己的币/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d849bf677b8fa83d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>稳定币不是双寡头：大公司要发自己的币</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多稳定币论战回归：Rob 说他知道有跨国公司正在发自己的稳定币，Circle 的 USDC 网络效应被低估，但利率降到 2-3% 时它的收入会腰斩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">稳定币</span><span class=\"tag\">代币化证券</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Fed Is Hiking Into A Growth Slowdown | Weekly Roundup terms of trade R minus G regulatory capture SPR dot plot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-forwardguidanc-美联储加息撞上增长放缓-欧洲要重走日本贬值老路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/446b9f7d49819e61-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Forward Guidance</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>美联储加息撞上增长放缓，欧洲要重走日本贬值老路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储在增长见顶时启动加息，而过去一年撑住美国消费的三四千亿美元「隐形中期刺激」正在退潮；Vincent Deluard 认为欧洲今天的处境就是 2012 年的日本，最终只能靠货币贬值解决。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">滞胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"687. Are Prediction Markets the Best Forecasting Tool Ever — or Just Another Casino? prediction market CFTC self-certification MNPI KYC decision market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-freakonomics-预测市场不是赌场-但九成交易量来自体育/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">48:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>预测市场不是赌场，但九成交易量来自体育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kalshi 用四年合规换来九成市场份额，但它的收入结构更像博彩公司；真正被低估的是 FDA 审批这类安静市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">预测市场</span><span class=\"tag\">监管合规</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Diffusion Will Win AI Inference with Inception Co-Founder and CEO Stefano Ermon diffusion model autoregressive model perplexity serving engine RL post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-nopriors-扩散模型不是图像专利-它要在推理时赢下语言模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d0b6b28d73eac46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">38:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>扩散模型不是图像专利，它要在推理时赢下语言模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">自回归推理必须一个 token 一个 token 顺序生成，是内存带宽瓶颈；扩散模型一次并行处理多个 token，推理负载更像训练，所以 Inception 押它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">扩散模型</span><span class=\"tag\">推理效率</span>\n</div></div></a>"]